2026-04-05 05:19:28.727 | 24908 (24908) | DEBUG    | Model response tool call: {"tool_name": "exit_plan_mode", "args": {"plan": "# Robustness Refactoring Plan \u2014 Document Renderer Core\n\nThis plan standardizes defensive programming and structural integrity across the document preview and editing layers.\n\n## 1. DocumentRenderer.tsx\n- **Existence Guards**: Add `if (!project)` guards to all sub-component triggers.\n- **Containment**: Implement a localized Error Boundary for the neural rendering pipeline.\n- **Fallback Logic**: Standardize the `ReportSteps` and `CoverPage` transitions to handle malformed project metadata gracefully.\n\n## 2. BuilderDocument.tsx\n- **Defensive Mapping**: Add explicit `instanceof` guards when iterating over `project.content`.\n- **Measurement Safety**: Wrap `getBoundingClientRect` and focal scroll logic in `try-catch` blocks with `requestAnimationFrame` guards to prevent stale ref crashes.\n- **Null Safety**: Ensure `SectionPreview` and `ChapterPreview` handle missing titles or content without layout shifts.\n\n## 3. SnapshotComparison.tsx\n- **Data Validation**: Add a validation pass for `snapshotData` before `Project` instantiation.\n- **Diff Containment**: Wrap `computeDiff` in a `try-catch` and provide a \"Diff Engine Error\" UI if markdown parsing fails.\n- **Visual Consistency**: Align header/footer with the \"Intelligence Suite\" technical aesthetic.\n\n## 4. A4Page.tsx\n- **Layout Robustness**: Add a default fallback for the `--zoom-scale` CSS variable in the inline style.\n- **Prose Safety**: Ensure the `MarkdownViewer` container handles extremely large content without overflowing the A4 boundary.\n\n## 5. MarkdownEditor.tsx\n- **Sync Integrity**: Add a `useEffect` guard to prevent cursor jumping or \"out-of-sync\" states during rapid section switching.\n\n## Target Files\n- `src/modules/ai-content/adapters/components/builder/renderer/DocumentRenderer.tsx`\n- `src/modules/ai-content/adapters/components/builder/renderer/BuilderDocument.tsx`\n- `src/modules/ai-content/adapters/components/builder/renderer/SnapshotComparison.tsx`\n- `src/components/shared/A4Page.tsx`\n- `src/modules/ai-content/adapters/components/builder/renderer/MarkdownEditor.tsx`\n"}, "tool_call_id": "pyd_ai_3adc70418c2340c3a2c24aa865440195", "id": null, "provider_name": "google-vertex", "provider_details": {"thought_signature": "ZTI0ODMwYTctNWNkNi00MmZlLTk5OGItZWU1MzllNzJiOWMz"}, "part_kind": "tool-call"}
